window.CET6_DATA("data/articles/day-049.json",{"day":49,"title":"A Shelter Where Dignity Came First","targetWords":[{"word":"assimilate","gloss":"适应融入","context":"Officials hoped families would quickly assimilate into their new surroundings, but that expectation proved a blunder.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"blunder","gloss":"失误","context":"Officials hoped families would quickly assimilate into their new surroundings, but that expectation proved a blunder.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"commend","gloss":"赞扬","context":"Volunteers could commend practical achievements and endorse patience without demanding gratitude.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"compress","gloss":"压缩","context":"Administrators wanted to compress all arrivals into a single registration period, yet caregivers began to frown at the pressure this created.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"endorse","gloss":"支持","context":"Volunteers could commend practical achievements and endorse patience without demanding gratitude.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"frown","gloss":"皱眉","context":"Administrators wanted to compress all arrivals into a single registration period, yet caregivers began to frown at the pressure this created.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"heave","gloss":"费力抬","context":"People had to heave wet possessions indoors after a long hike.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"hike","gloss":"步行","context":"People had to heave wet possessions indoors after a long hike.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"huddle","gloss":"挤在一起","context":"Children would huddle around relatives, and materials intended to insulate the hall could not protect them from uncertainty about where they would live next.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"insulate","gloss":"隔热","context":"Children would huddle around relatives, and materials intended to insulate the hall could not protect them from uncertainty about where they would live next.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"plough","gloss":"犁","context":"One farmer explained that he could no longer plough a field the river might submerge again.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"slap","gloss":"拍打","context":"A gentle slap on a table drew attention to his map, though an official's impatient stride toward the door suggested a lack of interest.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"stride","gloss":"迈步","context":"A gentle slap on a table drew attention to his map, though an official's impatient stride toward the door suggested a lack of interest.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"submerge","gloss":"淹没","context":"One farmer explained that he could no longer plough a field the river might submerge again.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"tilt","gloss":"倾斜","context":"The team had to tilt its priorities toward listening.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"torture","gloss":"折磨","context":"Repeated interviews could torture exhausted people with memories they had already described.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"trim","gloss":"修剪","context":"Volunteers would trim unnecessary questions and make space for a child to curl up beside a parent.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"curl","gloss":"蜷缩","context":"Volunteers would trim unnecessary questions and make space for a child to curl up beside a parent.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"fascinate","gloss":"吸引","context":"Rescue stories might fascinate journalists, but inspectors needed to inspect damp bedding and hear the quiet murmur of residents asking for medicine.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"inspect","gloss":"检查","context":"Rescue stories might fascinate journalists, but inspectors needed to inspect damp bedding and hear the quiet murmur of residents asking for medicine.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"murmur","gloss":"低语","context":"Rescue stories might fascinate journalists, but inspectors needed to inspect damp bedding and hear the quiet murmur of residents asking for medicine.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"overflow","gloss":"溢出","context":"When donated supplies began to overflow into the corridor, helpers learned not to pinch fingers in heavy boxes or rouse sleeping families unnecessarily.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"pinch","gloss":"夹","context":"When donated supplies began to overflow into the corridor, helpers learned not to pinch fingers in heavy boxes or rouse sleeping families unnecessarily.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"rouse","gloss":"唤醒","context":"When donated supplies began to overflow into the corridor, helpers learned not to pinch fingers in heavy boxes or rouse sleeping families unnecessarily.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"shave","gloss":"刮胡子","context":"An adult might need somewhere private to shave, and a teenager should not have to sneak into an empty room for a moment alone.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"sneak","gloss":"偷偷溜入","context":"An adult might need somewhere private to shave, and a teenager should not have to sneak into an empty room for a moment alone.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"spit","gloss":"吐","context":"Rules against behaviors such as choosing to spit indoors were necessary, but staff must not tease someone who misunderstood a notice.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"tease","gloss":"取笑","context":"Rules against behaviors such as choosing to spit indoors were necessary, but staff must not tease someone who misunderstood a notice.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"tuck","gloss":"掖","context":"A parent could tuck a blanket around a child without being disturbed.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"tug","gloss":"拉","context":"Children might tug at a volunteer's sleeve; nobody should whip up their fear by barking orders.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"whip","gloss":"激起","context":"Children might tug at a volunteer's sleeve; nobody should whip up their fear by barking orders.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"whistle","gloss":"吹口哨","context":"A whistle reserved for an emergency must not become a routine tool for controlling noise.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"bounce","gloss":"弹跳","context":"In a cleared play area, a soft ball could bounce safely without hitting someone's possessions.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"detain","gloss":"拘留","context":"Security staff should detain a person only with proper grounds, never because a tired visitor happened to deviate from an unfamiliar queue.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"deviate","gloss":"偏离","context":"Security staff should detain a person only with proper grounds, never because a tired visitor happened to deviate from an unfamiliar queue.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"fling","gloss":"猛扔","context":"Nobody was allowed to fling a bag aside or shove someone toward a desk.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"grope","gloss":"摸索","context":"At night, people might grope for a torch, kneel beside a bed, recite a comforting story, or shiver despite borrowed blankets.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"kneel","gloss":"跪","context":"At night, people might grope for a torch, kneel beside a bed, recite a comforting story, or shiver despite borrowed blankets.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"recite","gloss":"朗读","context":"At night, people might grope for a torch, kneel beside a bed, recite a comforting story, or shiver despite borrowed blankets.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"shiver","gloss":"发抖","context":"At night, people might grope for a torch, kneel beside a bed, recite a comforting story, or shiver despite borrowed blankets.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"shove","gloss":"推挤","context":"Nobody was allowed to fling a bag aside or shove someone toward a desk.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"sip","gloss":"小口喝","context":"A place to sip warm tea mattered.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"smuggle","gloss":"偷运","context":"The shelter tried to prevent anyone from having to smuggle basic supplies between rooms by explaining distribution clearly.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"stitch","gloss":"缝","context":"Volunteers could stitch a torn coat and stoop to hear a child without making a performance of their kindness.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"stoop","gloss":"弯腰","context":"Volunteers could stitch a torn coat and stoop to hear a child without making a performance of their kindness.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"thrust","gloss":"用力塞","context":"Officials learned not to thrust decisions upon residents simply because temporary housing was inconvenient to manage.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"yawn","gloss":"打哈欠","context":"A yawn during a late meeting indicated exhaustion, not disrespect.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"clasp","gloss":"握住","context":"To clasp an offered hand was welcome, but the shelter should not disappoint people who preferred distance.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"disappoint","gloss":"使失望","context":"To clasp an offered hand was welcome, but the shelter should not disappoint people who preferred distance.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"flare","gloss":"突发","context":"Anger might flare when news was unclear, making honest updates especially important.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"After a winter flood, the town opened a temporary shelter in a school. Officials hoped families would quickly assimilate into their new surroundings, but that expectation proved a blunder. A room full of strangers was not a home. Volunteers could commend practical achievements and endorse patience without demanding gratitude. Administrators wanted to compress all arrivals into a single registration period, yet caregivers began to frown at the pressure this created. People had to heave wet possessions indoors after a long hike. Children would huddle around relatives, and materials intended to insulate the hall could not protect them from uncertainty about where they would live next.","zh":"冬季洪水后，小镇在学校开设临时避难所。负责人希望家庭迅速适应新环境，但这一期待是个失误。满是陌生人的房间不是家。志愿者可以赞扬实际成果、支持耐心帮助，而不要求人们感恩。管理者想把所有人的到达压缩到同一登记时段，照护者却开始因这种压力皱眉。人们长途步行后，还得费力把湿物品搬进屋。孩子挤在亲人周围，用于大厅隔热的材料无法抵挡他们对未来住处的不安。"},{"en":"One farmer explained that he could no longer plough a field the river might submerge again. A gentle slap on a table drew attention to his map, though an official's impatient stride toward the door suggested a lack of interest. The team had to tilt its priorities toward listening. Repeated interviews could torture exhausted people with memories they had already described. Volunteers would trim unnecessary questions and make space for a child to curl up beside a parent. Rescue stories might fascinate journalists, but inspectors needed to inspect damp bedding and hear the quiet murmur of residents asking for medicine. Practical care began where public attention often ended.","zh":"一位农民解释说，他已经无法耕种那块可能再次被河水淹没的田地。他轻拍桌面，引人注意地图，但一位负责人不耐烦地大步走向门口，似乎缺乏兴趣。团队需要把重点向倾听调整。重复访谈可能以已讲过的回忆折磨疲惫的人。志愿者会删减无用问题，让孩子可以蜷在父母身旁。救援故事或许吸引记者，但检查者需要查看潮湿床具，听见住户轻声索要药物。实际照护从公众注意力往往结束的地方开始。"},{"en":"When donated supplies began to overflow into the corridor, helpers learned not to pinch fingers in heavy boxes or rouse sleeping families unnecessarily. An adult might need somewhere private to shave, and a teenager should not have to sneak into an empty room for a moment alone. Rules against behaviors such as choosing to spit indoors were necessary, but staff must not tease someone who misunderstood a notice. A parent could tuck a blanket around a child without being disturbed. Children might tug at a volunteer's sleeve; nobody should whip up their fear by barking orders. A whistle reserved for an emergency must not become a routine tool for controlling noise.","zh":"捐赠物资开始溢满走廊时，帮手学会不让重箱夹住手指，也不无故唤醒熟睡家庭。成年人可能需要私密地方刮胡子，少年也不应为了片刻独处而偷偷溜入空房。禁止在室内吐痰等规则是必要的，但工作人员不可取笑没看懂告示的人。家长可以不受打扰地给孩子掖好被子。孩子可能拉志愿者袖子，任何人都不应大声发号施令，让他们更加恐惧。用于紧急情况的哨声，不可成为控制噪声的日常手段。"},{"en":"In a cleared play area, a soft ball could bounce safely without hitting someone's possessions. Security staff should detain a person only with proper grounds, never because a tired visitor happened to deviate from an unfamiliar queue. Nobody was allowed to fling a bag aside or shove someone toward a desk. At night, people might grope for a torch, kneel beside a bed, recite a comforting story, or shiver despite borrowed blankets. A place to sip warm tea mattered. The shelter tried to prevent anyone from having to smuggle basic supplies between rooms by explaining distribution clearly. Volunteers could stitch a torn coat and stoop to hear a child without making a performance of their kindness.","zh":"清出的游戏区里，软球可以安全弹跳，不会撞到别人的物品。保安拘留人必须有适当依据，不能只因疲惫来访者偏离不熟悉的队伍。任何人都不可把包猛扔开，或把人推向登记台。夜间，人们可能摸索手电、跪在床边、朗读安慰性的故事，或裹着借来被子仍发抖。能小口喝热茶的地方很重要。避难所清楚解释分配方式，尽量避免人们需要在房间间偷运基本物资。志愿者可以缝补破外套，弯腰听孩子讲话，而不表演自己的善意。"},{"en":"Officials learned not to thrust decisions upon residents simply because temporary housing was inconvenient to manage. A yawn during a late meeting indicated exhaustion, not disrespect. To clasp an offered hand was welcome, but the shelter should not disappoint people who preferred distance. Anger might flare when news was unclear, making honest updates especially important. Gradually, families helped organize meals and decide quiet hours. The shelter remained imperfect, yet its approach changed: residents became participants rather than a collection of needs. Dignity was not an optional comfort after safety had been achieved. It was part of what made a safe place genuinely inhabitable.","zh":"负责人学会不因临时住处难管理，就把决定强加给居民。深夜会议中的哈欠表示疲倦，而非不尊重。握住伸来的手是受欢迎的，但避难所也不应让希望保持距离的人失望。消息不清时愤怒可能突然爆发，因此诚实更新格外重要。家庭逐渐参与组织餐食、决定安静时段。避难所仍不完美，但方式改变了：居民成为参与者，而不是一组需求。尊严不是安全实现之后可有可无的舒适，而是让安全场所真正适于居住的一部分。"}],"previous":48,"next":50});
